                "title": "Simple Door Lever Latchset",
                "description": "Simple in design with an easy installation, this door lever will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden) for a very smooth look. It fits any standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparation. The Solid Brass Simple Leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-752/00, Omnia simple door levers, Elegant door lever latchsets, Omnia 752 door levers, brass circular door levers, chic door levers, Omnia solid brass door lever latchsets, solid brass door levers, passage levers, privacy levers, dummy levers, Classic Door Levers, ada compliant levers, traditional levers, classic levers, omnia traditions collection"
